1. WHAT IS A SEARCHBAR COMPONENT?
================================================================================

SearchBar is a reusable component that handles the search UI.

Responsibilities:

- Display search input
- Display Search button
- Handle user input events
- Handle form submission
- Receive data and functions through props


Benefits:

- Reusable
- Maintainable
- Easier to test
- Keeps App.jsx cleaner
- Better separation of concerns


