================================================================================
9. DESTRUCTURING PROPS
================================================================================

Instead of:

function SearchBar(props) {

  return (
    <input
      value={props.searchTerm}
      onChange={props.onSearchChange}
    />
  );

}


Use destructuring:

function SearchBar({
  searchTerm,
  onSearchChange,
  onSearch
}) {

  return (

    <form onSubmit={onSearch}>

      <input
        value={searchTerm}
        onChange={onSearchChange}
      />

      <button type="submit">
        Search
      </button>

    </form>

  );

}


Benefits:

- Cleaner syntax
- Less repetition
- Easier to read


